# scope-drift-trimmer has no settings. The MVP reads files you exported yourself
# (AWS Access Analyzer output, an Entra Graph export, an agent inventory document),
# makes no network call and never holds a platform credential.
#
# If a later version adds a setting (a read-only live-fetch token, say), its name goes
# here with where to get its value, never the value. Copy this file to .env at the repo
# root to set it; the real environment wins over the file.
